And I was like, "Well, my very, very, very close friend

59
00:02:23.677 --> 00:02:25.957 line:15%
"is, you know, one of the nicest guys I've ever met.

60
00:02:25.957 --> 00:02:27.710 line:15%
"I think you guys would totally hit it off."

61
00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:28.543 line:15%
They hit it off.

62
00:02:28.543 --> 00:02:31.740
They fell madly in love and now they have a baby,

63
00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:32.600
which is crazy.

64
00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:35.090
It's like a true, a true match made in heaven.

65
00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.530
That is so cool.

66
00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:39.290
