93
00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:38.310
Chloë, I think everything you touch turns to gold.

94
00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:39.143
So, whether it's a film or just getting to work with you

95
00:03:39.143 --> 00:03:43.190
So, whether it's a film or just getting to work with you

